!!omap
  - id: F003
  - function: ReadIntBetween
  - range:
      - 74
      - 84
  - args:
      - int from
      - int to
  - return: int
  - requirement: !!omap
      - trigger: ''
      - action: ''
      - effect: ''
      - constraint: ''
  - code: "int ReadIntBetween(int from, int to)\n{\n  int choice = 0;\n  scanf(\"\
      %d\", &choice);\n  while (choice < from || choice > to)\n  {\n    printf(\"\\
      nPlease enter a number in the range [%d-%d]: \", from, to);\n    scanf(\"%d\"\
      , &choice);\n  }\n  return choice;\n}\n"
  - description: 指定された範囲内の整数をユーザーから入力させ、その値を返す関数です。範囲外の値が入力された場合は、再入力を促します。
